<!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
     Device-specific non-GKI QEMU kernel contract. NOT an Android LTS/GKI
     certification or a claim that upstream 7.3 belongs to an official FCM.
     Keep the actual 4-KiB rc6 kernel/audio unchanged; checkvintf still verifies
     all HAL/sepolicy requirements and these required built-in drivers. -->
